    'Open a plain terminal without tmux' \
    'Open or resume an independent persistent tmux terminal' \
    'Open the agent-aware Herdr workspace' \
    'Open the deliberately shared tmux main session' \
    'Show workspace windows as tabs' \
    'Create another tmux window in this terminal session' \
    'Copy a screenshot of all screens to the clipboard' \
    'Select a region and copy a screenshot to the clipboard' \
    'Move entire workspace to the monitor left (screen / output)' \
    'Move focused window to the monitor right (screen / output)' \
    'Mute or unmute the microphone' \
    'Play or pause music and media' \
    'Increase screen brightness by 5%' \
    'Make the focused window narrower' \
    '[reference only]'
